{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2022-04-21 16:33:00', 'title': "FMC CORPORATION ANNOUNCES NEW 'GREATER THAN GREEN' GLOBAL SUSTAINABILITY PLATFORM, RENEWS LONG-TERM ENVIRONMENTAL METRICS", 'text': "PHILADELPHIA , APRIL 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC), AN AGRICULTURAL SCIENCES COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW GLOBAL SUSTAINABILITY PLATFORM THAT ACCELERATES THE COMPANY'S GOALS ON CLIMATE CHANGE, FOOD SECURITY, CONSERVATION AND SOCIAL JUSTICE. THE PLATFORM BUILDS ON FMC'S 10 YEARS OF PROGRESS AND REPRESENTS THE NEXT EVOLUTION OF THE COMPANY'S ONGOING COMMITMENT TO ADVANCING SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURE, GLOBALLY."}